TEST INPUT FILES FOR DIRAC

run
% runtest

If pam is not in your path then run
% runtest --pampath="path to pam"

See
% runtest --help

An exerpt of the output is compared with the standard output contained in the
directory result in each example directory.  The differences are written both
in plain text (dif.txt) and html (dif.htm) format.

When adding new test runs don't forget to provide the sample output AND the
filter file in the directory result.
